WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.113 --> 01:37.960
=Episode 18=

01:41.120 --> 01:41.920
Open the door!

01:54.000 --> 01:54.719
Open the door!

01:55.159 --> 01:56.359
Let me out!

01:56.719 --> 01:57.879
Let me out!

02:24.680 --> 02:25.599
Open the door!

02:26.000 --> 02:27.199
Fire!

02:27.319 --> 02:28.240
Help!

02:28.240 --> 02:29.240
Open the door!

02:30.319 --> 02:31.599
Fire!

02:34.280 --> 02:35.520
Fire!

02:35.960 --> 02:37.719
Fire!

02:39.000 --> 02:39.960
Quick, put out the fire!

02:40.319 --> 02:41.080
Over here!

02:41.280 --> 02:41.759
Hurry!

02:41.759 --> 02:42.319
Coming!

02:42.759 --> 02:43.599
Quick, put out the fire!

02:53.520 --> 02:54.159
Quick!

02:54.680 --> 02:55.680
Get water, hurry!

02:55.680 --> 02:56.479
Put out the fire!

02:58.319 --> 02:59.400
Quick!

02:59.840 --> 03:00.400
Where is she?

03:01.280 --> 03:01.680
She ran away.

03:01.680 --> 03:02.120
Go after her.

03:02.680 --> 03:03.759
Go find her and bring her back!

03:03.919 --> 03:04.439
Yes.

03:05.572 --> 03:10.559
(Qiushui Pavilion)

03:11.439 --> 03:12.479
Sounds like

03:12.719 --> 03:13.639
the army is about to move.

03:13.639 --> 03:14.680
Once the fighting starts,

03:14.840 --> 03:16.199
the Yumen Pass will close in three days.

03:16.680 --> 03:18.360
The post station from Ganlin Town
to Nanzhou

03:18.360 --> 03:19.919
will certainly be commandeered
by the army.

03:20.120 --> 03:20.919
Young Lord Yu,

03:21.080 --> 03:22.319
if we wait any longer,
there'll be no way out.

03:22.439 --> 03:23.120
Pack up.

03:23.120 --> 03:23.520
Hurry.

03:24.759 --> 03:25.280
Wait.

03:25.280 --> 03:26.560
I still have one important thing to do.

03:26.960 --> 03:27.599
It'll be quick.

03:29.159 --> 03:30.520
Go find the Ninth Young Lady!

03:30.520 --> 03:31.240
Enough!

03:31.240 --> 03:32.439
What is there to look for?

03:32.759 --> 03:34.159
Ever since you came to Ganlin,

03:34.159 --> 03:35.080
because of that woman,

03:35.159 --> 03:36.520
you've been completely out of sorts!

03:36.520 --> 03:38.159
Don't forget
we're your superior officers,

03:38.240 --> 03:39.280
not your fathers!

03:39.280 --> 03:39.719
Let's go.

03:40.759 --> 03:41.439
Let's go.

03:41.599 --> 03:42.439
Let's go now.

03:45.360 --> 03:46.039
Young Master,

03:46.560 --> 03:48.000
she set that fire herself.

03:48.000 --> 03:48.800
She's seeking her own death.

03:48.800 --> 03:49.919
She's determined not to leave.

03:49.919 --> 03:50.960
You cannot throw your life away

03:50.960 --> 03:52.120
for a woman.

03:54.280 --> 03:55.400
Let's go, Young Master.

03:55.520 --> 03:56.319
Let's go.

04:09.199 --> 04:10.479
Eat more.

04:10.919 --> 04:12.039
Do you have enough clothes?

04:12.840 --> 04:13.599
Don't worry, Mother.

04:13.599 --> 04:14.520
Keep them safe.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.560
I wish you a safe journey.

04:17.040 --> 04:18.360
Make sure you come back safe.

04:19.199 --> 04:19.720
Move out.

04:32.600 --> 04:33.600
Where's Yucheng?

04:38.000 --> 04:39.079
Where's Yucheng?

04:47.040 --> 04:48.439
This is his blade.

04:51.519 --> 04:52.680
Where is he?

04:56.279 --> 04:57.959
He went with everyone else.

04:58.079 --> 05:00.079
Then why is he the only one
left on the mountain?

05:01.759 --> 05:03.199
Say something!

05:03.399 --> 05:04.040
Sen.

05:04.040 --> 05:04.560
Sen.

05:05.160 --> 05:05.800
Sen.

05:06.199 --> 05:07.560
Say something.

05:08.480 --> 05:10.240
Where is Yucheng?

05:16.639 --> 05:17.199
Let's go.

05:59.623 --> 06:03.102
(To my fiancee Fu Tingyun)

06:09.560 --> 06:10.120
Hurry.

06:10.759 --> 06:11.560
Catch up with the main force.

06:11.639 --> 06:12.079
Alright.

06:16.850 --> 06:19.750
(Western Expedition Army)

06:21.360 --> 06:21.839
Let's go.

06:25.199 --> 06:26.000
Zhao Ling.

06:28.040 --> 06:28.839
Zhao Ling.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.160
Zhao Ling, where are you?

06:34.879 --> 06:35.759
Zhao Ling.

06:39.759 --> 06:41.279
Zhao Ling, where are you?

06:41.600 --> 06:42.279
Miss.

06:45.439 --> 06:46.000
Miss.

06:46.240 --> 06:46.639
Who

06:46.639 --> 06:47.600
are you looking for?

06:47.879 --> 06:48.920
I'm looking for Commander Zhao.

06:49.240 --> 06:50.279
Where is Zhao Ling?

06:52.519 --> 06:53.680
You must be Miss Xie.

06:53.680 --> 06:55.439
Thanks to your restoration
of the bamboo slips,

06:55.720 --> 06:57.360
the troops' morale has soared.

06:57.639 --> 06:59.160
Commander Zhao is fine now.

07:00.519 --> 07:03.000
But the third drum for troop assembly
has already sounded.

07:03.120 --> 07:04.959
The army has already marched out.

07:09.839 --> 07:10.560
(Tingyun.)

07:11.000 --> 07:12.079
(The war is urgent.)

07:12.560 --> 07:13.920
(Though it pains me to leave you,)

07:14.639 --> 07:16.199
(I want this chance.)

07:17.600 --> 07:18.480
(Not only for you,)

07:19.519 --> 07:20.439
(but for myself,)

07:21.279 --> 07:22.199
(for Sen,)

07:22.800 --> 07:23.639
(for our brothers,)

07:25.959 --> 07:27.639
(for justice in this world.)

07:28.279 --> 07:29.040
(To my fiancee Fu Tingyun.)
(Tingyun.)

07:29.399 --> 07:30.519
(Give me five years.)

07:31.120 --> 07:32.120
(If I fall in battle,)

07:32.759 --> 07:34.240
(you must find a good match.)

07:34.759 --> 07:36.680
(I will become the stars
that light your wedding day.)

07:37.959 --> 07:39.240
(If I return alive,)

07:40.079 --> 07:41.759
(I will earn you merits beyond measure,)

07:42.720 --> 07:43.879
(offer you a noble title
as my betrothal gift,)

07:43.959 --> 07:45.000
(and pledge by the sun and moon.)

07:46.120 --> 07:47.319
(Where your heart goes,)

07:48.480 --> 07:49.600
(there I shall follow.)

08:03.800 --> 08:04.399
Mr. Zhao.

08:22.360 --> 08:23.439
(In our future,)

08:25.120 --> 08:26.240
(will we be married?)

08:29.879 --> 08:31.160
(Some couples in this world)

08:31.720 --> 08:32.799
(share a bed but not a heart,)

08:35.000 --> 08:36.240
(yet play the part in public.)

08:37.720 --> 08:38.919
(Some treat each other with respect,)

08:40.799 --> 08:42.039
(yet remain worlds apart.)

08:43.440 --> 08:44.519
(Some weather the storms together,)

08:46.559 --> 08:47.840
(yet still lose to time.)

08:50.039 --> 08:51.279
(Some have run their course,)

08:53.440 --> 08:54.759
(yet are bound together all the same.)

09:00.240 --> 09:00.919
(Tingyun.)

09:02.759 --> 09:03.639
(I want to ask you something.)

09:06.120 --> 09:07.440
(When we're married someday,)

09:09.600 --> 09:10.960
(what kind of couple
do you hope we'll be?)

09:12.519 --> 09:13.159
(Mr. Zhao.)

09:13.639 --> 09:15.200
(I want to cherish you)

09:15.879 --> 09:17.000
(and love you.)

09:17.600 --> 09:19.480
(Are we in love with each other?)

09:32.919 --> 09:34.879
Zhao Ling!

09:38.679 --> 09:41.039
Zhao Ling!

09:41.840 --> 09:44.360
Zhao Ling!

09:50.320 --> 09:52.679
Zhao Ling!

09:54.240 --> 09:56.559
Zhao Ling!

09:59.240 --> 10:00.360
Zhao Ling!

10:06.960 --> 10:09.120
Zhao Ling!

10:17.200 --> 10:19.639
Zhao Ling!

10:20.159 --> 10:22.480
Zhao Ling!

10:23.960 --> 10:24.639
Tingyun!

10:25.480 --> 10:27.399
Zhao Ling!

10:28.200 --> 10:29.039
Tingyun!

10:29.159 --> 10:30.039
Mr. Zhao.

10:30.039 --> 10:30.480
Don't go.

10:31.000 --> 10:32.000
It's too late.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.000
Tingyun!

10:33.480 --> 10:36.320
I'm here!

10:36.919 --> 10:37.879
I'll catch up soon.

10:37.879 --> 10:38.639
I'll catch up soon.

10:38.879 --> 10:39.600
Alright.

10:40.039 --> 10:40.480
Let's go.

10:54.432 --> 10:59.745
♪The wind sweeps the yellow sands,
as a grand ballad rings out♪

11:00.438 --> 11:04.111
♪A lone rider heads
for the distant frontier♪

11:04.200 --> 11:04.898
Mr. Zhao.

11:06.440 --> 11:07.039
Mr. Zhao.

11:07.092 --> 11:12.592
♪The road stretches on,
swallowed by wind and sand♪

11:14.200 --> 11:17.519
Take care of yourself!

11:38.609 --> 11:44.135
♪The wind howls,
yet never chills my soul♪

11:44.455 --> 11:49.970
♪War drums resound across the vast sky♪

11:50.656 --> 11:56.400
♪I laugh to the heavens to hide my sobs♪

11:56.723 --> 12:02.081
♪Looking back,
I see this life as a ballad♪

12:05.679 --> 12:07.159
I will wait for you to come back.

12:20.625 --> 12:26.051
♪Let the yellow sands bury the bones
of who I was♪

12:26.317 --> 12:32.240
♪Still, my resolve has never wavered♪

12:32.810 --> 12:38.476
♪I lift a cup of humble wine
to the passing breeze♪

12:38.776 --> 12:44.216
♪Looking back,
I see this life as a ballad♪

12:47.965 --> 12:51.478
♪Looking back,
I see this life as a song♪

12:51.519 --> 12:52.200
(Zhao Ling,)

12:53.240 --> 12:54.960
(I owe you a debt of love.)

12:56.440 --> 12:58.480
(Until now,
I thought that as your wife,)

12:59.080 --> 13:00.080
(it would be enough)

13:00.080 --> 13:01.240
(to respect and understand you.)

13:02.600 --> 13:04.759
(But now, I regret not loving you more,)

13:05.200 --> 13:05.840
(not cherishing you more.)

13:07.320 --> 13:09.759
(I only pray for your safety
on the battlefield.)

13:10.240 --> 13:11.759
(Do not rush to seek glory.)

13:12.480 --> 13:13.879
(I will be in Ganlin Town,)

13:14.480 --> 13:15.159
(longing and waiting)

13:15.960 --> 13:16.559
(Tingyun)
(for you.)

13:19.940 --> 13:21.960
(Mo Residence)

13:26.799 --> 13:27.600
Madam Mo.

13:32.759 --> 13:34.320
After the Yellow River Lantern Festival,

13:34.480 --> 13:36.360
to celebrate General Mo's reinstatement,

13:36.440 --> 13:37.039
Miss Xie

13:37.039 --> 13:37.799
had prepared this.

13:44.279 --> 13:44.720
Come.

13:45.000 --> 13:46.080
She's your sworn mother.

13:46.799 --> 13:47.799
My respects.

14:21.720 --> 14:23.000
Looking at this beautiful view,

14:23.960 --> 14:25.039
I feel

14:25.639 --> 14:27.279
my heart has opened up.

14:28.600 --> 14:30.039
In boundless desert
lonely smoke rises straight;

14:30.799 --> 14:32.360
Over endless river the sun sinks round.

14:32.600 --> 14:33.200
Miss Xie,

14:33.360 --> 14:34.360
did I recite it right?

14:42.200 --> 14:44.000
With such a beautiful view,

14:44.320 --> 14:45.919
the little troubles at home,

14:46.919 --> 14:48.080
past suffering,

14:48.559 --> 14:49.279
and unhappiness,

14:50.360 --> 14:51.320
all seem

14:52.080 --> 14:53.679
to drift away

14:55.120 --> 14:56.080
like clouds.

15:23.440 --> 15:25.159
(The ginkgo leaves in Ganlin Town)

15:25.159 --> 15:26.120
(are turning yellow.)

15:26.960 --> 15:28.799
(The whole yard will be golden.)

15:30.240 --> 15:32.799
(Sen practices his staff in the yard
before dawn every day.)

15:33.440 --> 15:35.080
(When the wind swirls the leaves up,)

15:35.360 --> 15:36.120
(he shouts,)

15:36.799 --> 15:38.279
("Cloud-Splitting Stance,
Mr. Zhao taught me this.")

15:38.960 --> 15:39.679
(Now,)

15:39.879 --> 15:41.960
(he can send three wooden stakes flying
with one strike.)

15:43.840 --> 15:46.200
(Zheng San fixed the old well pulley
in the corner of the yard.)

15:47.000 --> 15:48.840
(Sanniang steamed new wheat buns,)

15:49.120 --> 15:50.159
(stuffed with dates.)

15:50.679 --> 15:51.840
(She said when you return,)

15:51.960 --> 15:53.279
(she'd make sure you have a taste.)

15:57.360 --> 15:59.080
(Five years later)
(I did not, like other girls,)

15:59.480 --> 16:01.240
(sit in an empty room shedding tears.)

16:02.120 --> 16:03.240
(You said before you left,)

16:03.600 --> 16:04.720
("Wait for me
to earn my military glory.")

16:05.559 --> 16:07.679
(I carved your words
into the window paper.)

16:08.639 --> 16:09.919
(Not because
I wished you to fight recklessly,)

16:10.600 --> 16:12.600
(but because
I believed you would return alive.)

16:14.519 --> 16:16.399
(My love for you has never wavered.)

16:17.240 --> 16:18.919
(I only regret that we parted too soon.)

16:19.840 --> 16:20.840
(When you come back,)

16:21.720 --> 16:23.440
(I will give you a lifetime of devotion)

16:24.039 --> 16:25.559
(in return for the knot we tied.)

16:27.279 --> 16:28.039
(Stay safe.)

16:29.000 --> 16:29.840
(Return soon.)

16:29.880 --> 16:35.440
♪Bearing wings through stormy tides,
wash away stain of false accusation♪

16:35.613 --> 16:41.640
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

16:41.953 --> 16:47.280
♪Let this humble name carry me
through a life adrift♪

16:48.236 --> 16:53.760
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

16:54.290 --> 16:57.023
♪Let the past remain beyond recall♪

16:57.070 --> 17:01.590
♪Trade it for boundless blue skies
to fly free and far♪

17:01.903 --> 17:05.170
♪I seek no mercy lent by mortal world♪

17:05.200 --> 17:06.079
Yucheng.

17:10.000 --> 17:10.640
Cheers.

17:20.011 --> 17:23.584
(Tomb of Yang Yucheng)

17:30.058 --> 17:35.380
♪Once a bird among the clouds,
now fallen into the mortal world♪

17:36.430 --> 17:41.403
♪Inviting frost to my temples,
veiling the face of bygone days♪

17:41.438 --> 17:42.184
(Zhao Ling,)

17:42.319 --> 17:43.279
(over these years,)

17:43.559 --> 17:44.839
(I've run a women's school,)

17:44.920 --> 17:45.920
(restored bamboo slips,)

17:46.319 --> 17:47.400
(redesigned military uniforms,)

17:47.960 --> 17:50.240
(been commended three times
and entered the county records.)

17:50.559 --> 17:52.000
(I've earned my own footing
in this world.)

17:53.960 --> 17:54.680
(Zhao Ling,)

17:56.079 --> 17:57.759
(I want to be your stronghold too.)

17:57.957 --> 18:01.120
♪Through a life adrift♪

18:01.917 --> 18:04.378
♪With wit and strategy♪

18:04.400 --> 18:05.599
(The battlefield stretches endlessly.)

18:06.640 --> 18:07.880
(Beacon fires burn without cease.)

18:09.720 --> 18:11.559
(When I think
of fighting alongside my men,)

18:12.279 --> 18:14.160
(knowing it protects our families
and loved ones,)

18:15.240 --> 18:16.319
(it feels worth it.)

18:18.240 --> 18:18.839
(Don't worry.)

18:19.599 --> 18:20.440
(For you,)

18:20.599 --> 18:21.680
(I will be careful with my life.)

18:23.680 --> 18:25.400
(The more death I have seen,)

18:26.519 --> 18:27.680
(the more I want to live.)

18:29.200 --> 18:30.519
(The more I want to see you.)

18:32.519 --> 18:33.440
(Tingyun.)

18:35.400 --> 18:37.000
(You are my anchor.)

18:38.960 --> 18:39.880
Miss Xie!

18:40.039 --> 18:40.799
Miss Xie!

18:40.920 --> 18:42.440
Great victory at the border!

18:43.079 --> 18:44.279
Great victory at the border.

18:44.799 --> 18:46.319
The brothers at the front say

18:46.400 --> 18:47.599
Mr. Zhao has earned military merits.

18:47.799 --> 18:49.039
He'll soon return to the capital
for his reward.

18:49.359 --> 18:50.240
Should we

18:50.440 --> 18:51.799
also head back to the capital

18:52.119 --> 18:53.279
to welcome Mr. Zhao?

18:57.433 --> 18:58.952
(We'll meet again soon.
Take care. Zhao Ling.)

19:01.960 --> 19:02.720
Back to the capital.

19:05.372 --> 19:09.023
(The Capital)

19:14.188 --> 19:15.094
(Li Residence)

19:22.440 --> 19:23.839
(Word spreads in the army)

19:23.839 --> 19:25.160
(that he kills
without spilling a drop of blood.)

19:25.359 --> 19:26.599
(And his men)

19:26.599 --> 19:28.240
(stop at nothing
to earn military merit.)

19:28.920 --> 19:30.759
(No wonder he's so young)

19:30.759 --> 19:31.920
(yet has earned so many merits.)

19:32.279 --> 19:33.039
(He rose all the way to become)

19:33.039 --> 19:35.119
(a senior fourth-rank
assistant commander in the northwest.)

19:36.279 --> 19:37.039
Commander Zhao.

19:37.960 --> 19:39.319
If you have family members
to accompany you,

19:39.640 --> 19:41.240
please pack your belongings quickly

19:41.519 --> 19:42.759
and return to the capital with us.

19:42.759 --> 19:43.240
No need.

19:44.759 --> 19:46.160
I will go back alone.

19:46.440 --> 19:47.640
Commander Zhao, I heard

19:47.640 --> 19:48.880
you have a fiancee.

19:49.200 --> 19:50.759
Won't you go to Ganlin Town
to pick her up?

19:50.759 --> 19:51.440
I am

19:55.440 --> 19:56.480
not yet betrothed.

20:16.759 --> 20:17.759
Long time no see,

20:19.279 --> 20:20.119
Advisor Li.

20:22.599 --> 20:23.000
Oh no.

20:24.799 --> 20:25.880
Now you're

20:26.440 --> 20:28.559
the Director of the Revenue Division
in the Ministry of Revenue.

20:30.799 --> 20:31.559
I see.

20:32.599 --> 20:34.000
Once you board the Yu family's ship,

20:35.160 --> 20:36.319
your career certainly runs smoother.

20:36.799 --> 20:38.039
Speaking of smooth...

20:38.759 --> 20:40.599
How could I ever compare to you,

20:41.359 --> 20:42.440
Commander Zhao?

20:46.079 --> 20:47.640
When you were stationed
in the Gandu Circuit,

20:48.720 --> 20:50.160
you abused your power

20:50.480 --> 20:51.720
and embezzled silver.

20:52.359 --> 20:53.839
Now the evidence is solid.

20:54.799 --> 20:56.799
By law, I am to arrest you.

20:57.519 --> 20:58.559
You are nothing

20:58.559 --> 21:01.359
but a minor Assistant Commander
from the northwest.

21:02.480 --> 21:04.680
What right do you have
to arrest a capital official?

21:05.119 --> 21:06.440
By our dynasty's law,

21:06.759 --> 21:08.440
you must report
to the Ministry of Justice,

21:08.640 --> 21:10.119
and go through a joint trial
by the Three Judicial Offices.

21:10.480 --> 21:12.759
Only after conviction
can you make an arrest.

21:13.759 --> 21:16.279
Today, you barge into my house
with soldiers.

21:16.599 --> 21:18.920
This is outright lawlessness.

21:19.160 --> 21:20.680
It's personal revenge.

21:23.799 --> 21:24.960
Tell me yourself,

21:26.160 --> 21:27.960
what personal grudge do we have?

21:29.519 --> 21:31.359
You have no evidence.

21:32.039 --> 21:33.880
What is there to say to you?

21:34.400 --> 21:35.359
Evidence?

21:39.599 --> 21:41.079
If I want it, it can exist.

21:44.200 --> 21:45.920
As much

21:47.480 --> 21:49.039
as I need.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.720
This is nothing

21:51.720 --> 21:53.960
but a blatant frame-up!

21:54.680 --> 21:57.119
Since I had the nerve
to come and arrest you,

21:58.880 --> 22:01.359
I am confident
I can find that embezzled silver.

22:02.000 --> 22:03.319
I advise you to hand it over now

22:03.880 --> 22:05.000
and call it a confession.

22:06.400 --> 22:08.160
Name the co-conspirators behind you,

22:08.160 --> 22:09.400
and I'll count it as your merit.

22:10.039 --> 22:10.880
What merit would I need?

22:11.559 --> 22:12.799
I am an honest official.

22:13.039 --> 22:14.160
I have nothing to hide.

22:14.799 --> 22:15.640
As for you,

22:15.839 --> 22:16.880
you overstepped your jurisdiction,

22:16.880 --> 22:17.920
and slandered a loyal official.

22:18.119 --> 22:19.480
I'll petition the Emperor himself!

22:20.640 --> 22:22.160
Then you,

22:22.920 --> 22:25.599
that wretched woman
you haven't even married,

22:26.160 --> 22:27.519
and all you

22:27.839 --> 22:29.880
northwestern mongrels

22:30.880 --> 22:32.839
will all come down with me.

22:35.720 --> 22:36.559
What a pity.

22:39.119 --> 22:41.000
I have few family ties.

22:42.559 --> 22:43.920
No faction, no wife.

22:44.720 --> 22:46.079
Nothing to hold me back.

22:50.480 --> 22:52.000
So I will see your case through

22:57.799 --> 22:59.920
to the very end.

23:05.638 --> 23:06.698
(Li Residence)

23:06.720 --> 23:07.359
Mr. Zhao.

23:08.480 --> 23:09.839
Miss Xie arrives
in the capital tomorrow.

23:10.200 --> 23:11.079
Aren't you going to see her?

23:23.640 --> 23:24.400
(My Lord,)

23:24.599 --> 23:25.880
(have mercy on me.)

23:26.279 --> 23:27.640
(I've been with him all these years,)

23:27.640 --> 23:28.920
(and never enjoyed a moment
of good fortune.)

23:29.200 --> 23:31.000
(I'm only being dragged down by him.)

23:44.200 --> 23:45.960
(I have summoned you back
to report on your duties.)

23:46.160 --> 23:48.160
(You are to secretly investigate
the embezzlement of military funds.)

23:48.640 --> 23:50.160
(Arrest the corrupt officials)

23:50.359 --> 23:51.480
(who have undermined the state.)

23:52.559 --> 23:54.440
(I have few family ties.)

23:55.200 --> 23:56.640
(No faction, no wife.)

23:57.200 --> 23:58.599
(Nothing to hold me back.)

23:59.079 --> 24:01.559
(To the very end.)

24:10.794 --> 24:13.601
(Capital Specialties)

24:23.160 --> 24:24.039
Your mother

24:24.039 --> 24:25.000
lives outside the capital.

24:25.240 --> 24:26.599
She rarely comes into the city.

24:27.119 --> 24:28.000
You two

24:28.160 --> 24:29.319
should have a good talk.

24:31.880 --> 24:32.799
Thank you, Uncle.

25:19.960 --> 25:20.799
Tingyun.

25:22.799 --> 25:23.599
Mother.

25:24.319 --> 25:25.440
My dear daughter.

25:37.200 --> 25:38.200
Not bad.

25:38.799 --> 25:40.960
You don't look like you've suffered.

25:54.519 --> 25:56.039
But your hands

25:57.759 --> 25:59.119
are a bit rough.

26:03.480 --> 26:04.680
I've failed you, Mother.

26:05.559 --> 26:06.599
All these years,

26:07.240 --> 26:09.240
I couldn't stay by your side.

26:09.599 --> 26:11.160
It's enough that you're back.

26:12.119 --> 26:13.079
I never thought

26:13.920 --> 26:15.319
we

26:15.720 --> 26:17.119
would ever see each other again.

26:32.119 --> 26:33.160
All these years,

26:33.960 --> 26:35.440
reading your letters,

26:35.839 --> 26:37.799
watching you grow,

26:38.640 --> 26:39.880
making new friends,

26:41.039 --> 26:42.480
I felt as though I was

26:43.119 --> 26:44.559
living a new life through you.

26:46.319 --> 26:47.759
If you hadn't entrusted me

26:48.599 --> 26:50.160
to Mr. Zhao back then,

26:51.319 --> 26:52.640
I would never be where I am today.

26:53.279 --> 26:55.680
You've always been a girl
with a mind of your own.

26:56.759 --> 26:57.799
I simply

26:57.799 --> 26:59.519
tried whatever I could.

26:59.880 --> 27:01.480
But your judgment was right.

27:02.480 --> 27:03.839
You saw something in Zhao Ling.

27:04.640 --> 27:05.480
The two of you

27:06.000 --> 27:07.480
were meant to be.

27:12.759 --> 27:14.319
But I fear, Mother,

27:17.240 --> 27:19.400
he pulled me

27:19.400 --> 27:20.359
out of one deadly situation,

27:22.359 --> 27:23.960
only for me to lead him

27:23.960 --> 27:25.319
into another,

27:26.079 --> 27:27.839
one where he has to bet his life

27:28.319 --> 27:30.400
on his career and future.

27:38.279 --> 27:39.759
In this world,

27:39.880 --> 27:41.920
loss and gain

27:42.519 --> 27:43.880
balance each other.

27:48.720 --> 27:49.920
What matters is

27:50.599 --> 27:52.480
that the two of you are united in heart.

27:52.720 --> 27:53.480
So you must

27:53.759 --> 27:55.039
stand together

27:56.039 --> 27:57.319
and take the same risks.

28:00.200 --> 28:02.279
All this time,
I've longed for your return,

28:04.319 --> 28:06.000
and yet I've also dreaded it.

28:14.759 --> 28:16.680
How have you been all these years,
Mother?

28:19.160 --> 28:20.319
And Father,

28:22.880 --> 28:24.279
is he well?

28:24.920 --> 28:26.559
Your father lives outside the capital,

28:27.359 --> 28:28.640
in a hut, observing mourning.

28:29.960 --> 28:32.920
I keep him company, eating simply,
living quietly, chanting sutras.

28:33.359 --> 28:34.599
All is well.

28:36.279 --> 28:37.920
Your seventh sister-in-law

28:38.599 --> 28:39.880
is very virtuous and filial.

28:40.440 --> 28:42.359
She travels to and from the outskirts
every day,

28:42.359 --> 28:43.200
attending to us

28:43.599 --> 28:44.960
without ever growing weary.

28:52.319 --> 28:53.279
Father...

28:56.720 --> 28:58.400
is he still unable to acknowledge me?

29:02.039 --> 29:03.039
Everything

29:03.119 --> 29:04.359
takes time.

29:07.319 --> 29:09.119
For now, just settle down,

29:09.599 --> 29:11.359
and take care of your own affairs.

29:13.319 --> 29:14.079
I have

29:14.960 --> 29:16.559
my own plans.

29:17.480 --> 29:19.319
You need not worry about me.

29:32.359 --> 29:33.039
Miss.

29:33.160 --> 29:34.000
This area here

29:34.000 --> 29:35.640
is next to the Imperial Academy
and the Temple of Confucius.

29:35.759 --> 29:36.839
Those who come and go

29:36.839 --> 29:38.319
are all scholars and learned men.

29:38.559 --> 29:40.359
Every student passing through here

29:40.519 --> 29:42.400
is either rich or noble.

29:43.799 --> 29:45.200
This residence ahead

29:45.200 --> 29:46.000
looks quite fine.

29:46.119 --> 29:47.200
What is the asking price?

29:48.559 --> 29:50.000
You are not yet married, miss.

29:50.440 --> 29:52.559
May I ask which family you come from?

29:52.559 --> 29:53.839
Are you betrothed?

29:54.119 --> 29:55.599
What official post
does your future husband hold

29:55.599 --> 29:56.799
at court?

29:56.799 --> 29:57.720
You

29:58.039 --> 29:59.880
just worry about who paid for the house.

29:59.880 --> 30:01.240
Why bother about her husband's family?

30:01.359 --> 30:03.079
You won't be shortchanged either way.

30:04.519 --> 30:06.079
I come from the Xie family of Jiangnan.

30:06.400 --> 30:08.440
The Xie businesses in the capital

30:08.440 --> 30:10.000
belong to my mother and my uncle.

30:11.279 --> 30:12.839
Though I am not from an official family,

30:13.160 --> 30:14.480
I do have some means.

30:15.119 --> 30:16.480
When choosing a residence,

30:16.640 --> 30:17.799
I go by feeling.

30:18.240 --> 30:19.200
I pay in silver, upfront.

30:19.839 --> 30:21.039
I'd like to settle it soon

30:21.039 --> 30:21.839
to arrange for my move.

30:22.359 --> 30:24.000
But this residence

30:24.440 --> 30:26.319
has already caught the eye
of Young Madam Yu.

30:26.559 --> 30:28.160
She wants to buy it for her father,

30:28.279 --> 30:29.880
Master Fan, to use for his academy.

30:30.799 --> 30:31.960
As for this house,

30:32.079 --> 30:33.440
its previous owner

30:33.440 --> 30:34.720
held the post

30:34.720 --> 30:36.240
of Director of the Revenue Division
in the Ministry of Revenue.

30:36.599 --> 30:38.400
I truly mean no offense.

30:38.559 --> 30:39.680
But the Yu family

30:39.680 --> 30:41.599
has long been rooted in the capital.

30:41.960 --> 30:43.519
If she buys this house,

30:43.680 --> 30:46.039
every property on this street
will go up in value.

30:47.359 --> 30:48.440
You make a fair point.

30:49.559 --> 30:51.359
But my purchase today

30:51.559 --> 30:52.480
is not just

30:52.480 --> 30:54.279
a single transaction with you.

30:55.720 --> 30:57.319
I come from the Gandu military circuit.

30:57.440 --> 30:58.640
I have ties

30:58.640 --> 30:59.559
to northwest military families.

31:00.200 --> 31:01.240
I have come ahead

31:01.519 --> 31:03.039
to scout the way for them.

31:03.599 --> 31:05.559
We are used to living near one another.

31:06.119 --> 31:07.319
If I settle here

31:07.440 --> 31:08.720
and make this my home,

31:09.079 --> 31:11.039
then the entire street

31:11.240 --> 31:12.759
will be filled
with military officers' wives.

31:13.960 --> 31:15.039
If you sell to me,

31:15.240 --> 31:16.359
you are truly

31:16.359 --> 31:17.839
selling an entire street of prosperity.

31:19.279 --> 31:19.920
Sister.

31:19.926 --> 31:20.546
(Wanfang Garden)

31:20.559 --> 31:21.599
- Come.
- Long time no see.

31:21.599 --> 31:22.160
Indeed.

31:22.759 --> 31:23.559
Sister,

31:24.200 --> 31:25.200
I'd like to meet

31:25.200 --> 31:26.559
this remarkable woman from Gandu,

31:26.759 --> 31:28.200
and see what she's really like.

31:28.519 --> 31:30.279
One purchase,
and she takes an entire street.

31:30.680 --> 31:32.279
Even I have to step back.

31:32.720 --> 31:34.160
You said you wanted to meet her.

31:34.359 --> 31:35.720
So I invited her here

31:35.720 --> 31:36.720
to set the stage for you.

31:37.160 --> 31:37.960
They say

31:37.960 --> 31:39.279
she's a remarkable woman.

31:39.599 --> 31:40.480
She has been

31:40.480 --> 31:41.720
entered into the county records
three times.

31:42.480 --> 31:43.359
Three times?

31:44.160 --> 31:45.039
For what, exactly?

31:45.759 --> 31:46.599
First,

31:46.960 --> 31:48.240
establishing a women's school

31:48.240 --> 31:49.359
and educating the people.

31:49.759 --> 31:50.640
Second,

31:50.799 --> 31:51.960
compiling bamboo slips

31:51.960 --> 31:53.160
to restore local history.

31:53.720 --> 31:54.519
Third,

31:55.279 --> 31:56.559
improving military uniforms

31:56.559 --> 31:57.839
to boost troop morale.

32:04.640 --> 32:05.680
Tingyun?

32:19.480 --> 32:21.319
Aren't you the one
with all that Huzhou silk?

32:21.720 --> 32:22.839
Why are you here?

32:23.759 --> 32:25.799
Wanfang Garden is open to all.

32:26.240 --> 32:28.480
Scholars from everywhere
can rent space and host banquets.

32:29.119 --> 32:30.000
Tingyun must be

32:30.000 --> 32:31.640
a guest invited
by one of the poetry clubs.

32:32.160 --> 32:33.200
But

32:34.599 --> 32:36.440
why are you still dressed
as an unmarried lady?

32:37.519 --> 32:38.680
If I remember correctly,

32:39.039 --> 32:40.640
you are twenty-four this year.

32:40.720 --> 32:42.200
Twenty-four and still not married.

32:42.200 --> 32:42.640
Indeed.

32:43.839 --> 32:45.240
My betrothed is named Zhao.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.200
He serves in the Gandu military circuit

32:47.480 --> 32:49.279
as a fourth-rank assistant commander.

32:49.680 --> 32:50.680
Could it be

32:50.680 --> 32:51.720
the very same Zhao Ling

32:51.720 --> 32:53.160
who has been making waves
in the capital,

32:53.640 --> 32:54.440
Commander Zhao?

32:54.759 --> 32:56.400
Isn't he still unmarried?

32:56.680 --> 32:57.359
Right.

32:58.319 --> 32:59.839
When we were in Yongning Prefecture,

32:59.839 --> 33:01.240
I didn't catch your surname.

33:01.359 --> 33:02.440
I only remember

33:02.440 --> 33:04.000
you were wearing Huzhou silk.

33:05.519 --> 33:06.359
My surname

33:06.359 --> 33:07.119
is Xie.

33:07.119 --> 33:08.079
Xie?

33:08.680 --> 33:09.160
Then

33:09.680 --> 33:11.200
did you come from the northwest?

33:11.680 --> 33:12.200
Yes.

33:12.480 --> 33:14.599
I've been with the army in Ganlin Town
for five years now.

33:17.279 --> 33:18.920
You are that remarkable woman.

33:19.279 --> 33:20.400
Miss Xie

33:20.400 --> 33:21.480
of Ganlin Town.

33:21.960 --> 33:23.079
Miss Xie?

33:24.319 --> 33:25.839
What a rare guest indeed.

33:25.839 --> 33:26.960
It's quite sunny out here.

33:26.960 --> 33:28.000
Please go inside and take a seat.

33:28.160 --> 33:29.240
All of you, keep her company.

33:37.039 --> 33:38.480
Look at what I've done.

33:38.720 --> 33:39.799
I didn't get the full picture

33:39.799 --> 33:40.960
before inviting her.

33:41.200 --> 33:42.039
Who would have known

33:42.039 --> 33:44.000
it's Miss Xie,
the one with a history with you?

33:44.720 --> 33:45.839
But don't worry.

33:46.119 --> 33:47.319
I'll lend you

33:47.319 --> 33:48.480
whatever money you need.

33:49.559 --> 33:51.480
And as for that residence
in Shijia Hutong,

33:51.640 --> 33:52.960
it will be yours soon enough.

33:52.960 --> 33:54.480
Just focus on your lectures.

33:59.467 --> 34:01.273
(Qinfang Pavilion)

34:02.799 --> 34:04.200
Dongshan Poetry Talks

34:04.359 --> 34:06.279
was compiled by my father

34:06.279 --> 34:07.119
with all his life's effort.

34:07.799 --> 34:09.320
He poured his whole life

34:09.679 --> 34:10.800
into compiling it.

34:10.880 --> 34:11.440
Whenever cited...

34:11.440 --> 34:12.639
Tell us about Young Lord Yu.

34:14.239 --> 34:15.400
Young Lord Yu.

34:17.400 --> 34:19.239
Whenever cited,
the poem's source is noted.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.199
Every discussion of art

34:20.320 --> 34:21.280
traces its origins.

34:21.679 --> 34:23.440
He examines the evolution
of Tang and Song prosody,

34:23.639 --> 34:25.760
and critiques our dynasty's poets.

34:26.079 --> 34:27.519
The chapter on Threefold Essence

34:27.880 --> 34:28.920
is his finest work.

34:29.490 --> 34:31.197
(Dongshan Poetry Talks)

34:32.159 --> 34:32.559
Look.

34:32.840 --> 34:33.679
It's an orchid.

34:34.239 --> 34:34.960
I heard

34:35.159 --> 34:36.920
that Young Madam Yu and Young Lord Yu

34:37.119 --> 34:38.480
first bonded over orchids.

34:38.840 --> 34:39.519
How about

34:39.840 --> 34:41.119
telling us that story?

34:41.280 --> 34:42.440
Yes, please.

34:42.440 --> 34:43.400
Do tell.

34:43.559 --> 34:44.440
Share it with us.

34:46.840 --> 34:47.800
Go on.

34:48.599 --> 34:50.199
Since everyone wants to hear it,

34:50.199 --> 34:51.119
go ahead and share.

34:56.599 --> 34:57.920
When Young Lord Yu

35:01.400 --> 35:03.360
was studying under my father,

35:03.679 --> 35:05.119
he found the orchid I had cultivated.

35:05.760 --> 35:07.360
That was how we first met.

35:07.760 --> 35:09.239
Later, at a poetry gathering,

35:09.320 --> 35:10.639
he chose me as the winner,

35:10.880 --> 35:11.800
saying

35:13.119 --> 35:14.800
I had captured what was in his heart.

35:15.800 --> 35:17.719
How wonderful.

35:17.719 --> 35:18.719
And then what?

35:19.440 --> 35:21.039
I had some talents when I was young.

35:21.400 --> 35:23.360
Later, when Madam Yu passed
through Huaying County,

35:23.639 --> 35:24.880
she named me a notable young lady.

35:25.599 --> 35:27.559
And out of gratitude
for my father's teaching,

35:28.119 --> 35:28.880
the two families

35:29.239 --> 35:30.159
tied the knot

35:30.920 --> 35:31.880
and set a wedding date.

35:33.280 --> 35:35.199
Young Lord Yu is a top scholar
who excelled in all three exams,

35:35.320 --> 35:36.519
and comes from a distinguished family.

35:36.599 --> 35:38.360
Young Madam Yu, you sure
made an excellent match.

35:38.360 --> 35:39.760
Truly.

35:39.760 --> 35:41.039
An excellent match.

35:41.039 --> 35:41.639
Then

35:41.639 --> 35:43.400
how can we also find

35:43.400 --> 35:44.400
such a fine husband?

35:44.400 --> 35:44.760
Indeed.

35:44.760 --> 35:46.400
Please, tell us.

35:46.519 --> 35:48.480
Why tell everything all at once?

35:48.719 --> 35:50.760
Let us wait until next time
for the rest.

35:52.733 --> 35:53.860
(Dongshan Poetry Talks)

35:57.199 --> 35:59.440
Young Madam Yu is indeed talented.

35:59.800 --> 36:01.000
She certainly knows
how to make things up.

36:02.079 --> 36:03.320
She relies on that to hold her own.

36:03.920 --> 36:05.360
Why spoil it for her?

36:06.400 --> 36:07.000
No matter.

36:14.840 --> 36:16.079
Madam Wei, you're quite something.

36:16.440 --> 36:17.360
You've made this gathering

36:17.360 --> 36:18.519
a great success.

36:18.960 --> 36:20.199
Young ladies of the capital

36:20.199 --> 36:21.159
all vie for invitations.

36:22.760 --> 36:24.159
It's only reading books

36:24.159 --> 36:25.159
and selling them,

36:25.239 --> 36:26.679
earning a bit of silver.

36:26.760 --> 36:28.159
It also expands your network

36:28.760 --> 36:29.800
and helps with social connections.

36:35.320 --> 36:36.960
Have you ever wondered, Madam,

36:37.119 --> 36:38.599
why Young Madam Yu

36:38.880 --> 36:40.880
insists on buying that residence
in Shijia Hutong?

36:42.119 --> 36:44.599
It's for her father, Master Fan.

36:45.000 --> 36:46.760
That's quite filial of her.

36:48.119 --> 36:49.679
I've heard that Master Fan

36:49.679 --> 36:51.119
prefers peace and quiet,

36:51.639 --> 36:53.119
and detests bustling places.

36:58.519 --> 36:59.639
What do you mean?

37:02.159 --> 37:03.320
The neighbors around that residence

37:03.320 --> 37:05.320
are all high-ranking officials.

37:05.480 --> 37:06.840
She won't lack for tuition fees,

37:06.840 --> 37:08.599
nor for students of good standing.

37:09.079 --> 37:11.000
It raises her status

37:11.000 --> 37:12.239
and expands her network.

37:13.079 --> 37:14.679
Once she's strong enough,

37:15.119 --> 37:16.239
these gatherings

37:16.679 --> 37:18.719
won't need to rely on you anymore.

37:24.280 --> 37:26.000
I heard it from the matchmaker.

37:26.440 --> 37:28.639
Young Madam Yu
wants to set up a school for her father.

37:28.719 --> 37:30.000
That's what made me think of this.

37:33.079 --> 37:34.599
It seems Young Madam Yu

37:34.599 --> 37:36.199
wants to start her own operation.

37:36.880 --> 37:38.719
If Huzhou Silk hadn't reminded me,

37:39.360 --> 37:40.760
I'd still be in the dark.

37:43.760 --> 37:45.360
Go and tell Young Madam Yu

37:46.039 --> 37:46.920
that

37:46.920 --> 37:49.159
the silver in my account
is needed elsewhere.

37:49.480 --> 37:50.960
She'll have to figure it out herself.

37:51.519 --> 37:52.159
Yes.

37:54.440 --> 37:55.000
Miss Xie.

37:55.031 --> 37:55.957
(Deed)

37:55.958 --> 37:59.860
(Deed drawn up by Li Mao)

37:59.920 --> 38:02.079
(The original owner
of this residence is Lord Li.)

38:05.599 --> 38:07.559
This deed, dated twenty years ago,

38:08.072 --> 38:08.920
(Ninth Year of Dacheng)
is written

38:09.039 --> 38:11.000
on paper made last year.

38:12.280 --> 38:14.000
This is clearly a forged deed.

38:14.559 --> 38:15.159
Zheng San.

38:15.719 --> 38:16.639
Take this deed

38:16.840 --> 38:17.840
to

38:17.840 --> 38:18.960
the Ministry of Justice prison,

38:19.159 --> 38:19.920
(Deed)
and give it to Mr. Zhao.

38:21.920 --> 38:22.760
Lord Li.

38:23.840 --> 38:24.800
What do you have

38:26.840 --> 38:27.760
to say about this residence?

38:28.559 --> 38:29.800
This residence

38:30.519 --> 38:32.880
was already sold twenty years ago.

38:33.719 --> 38:34.880
At that time,

38:35.079 --> 38:36.760
I had not yet taken up my post.

38:37.440 --> 38:38.599
So how

38:39.679 --> 38:41.320
could there be embezzlement?

38:48.400 --> 38:49.599
Then how is it

38:51.320 --> 38:53.679
that this deed is written on paper

38:55.960 --> 38:57.280
that was only made last year?

39:03.760 --> 39:05.159
Forging an official deed

39:06.360 --> 39:07.840
and giving false testimony.

39:09.920 --> 39:10.719
By law,

39:11.360 --> 39:12.400
100 strokes

39:14.079 --> 39:15.840
and exile for 3,000 li.

39:20.000 --> 39:21.639
Lord Li, you're already standing

39:21.639 --> 39:23.920
at death's door.

39:26.199 --> 39:27.639
The one behind you

39:28.679 --> 39:30.800
is already distancing himself from you.

39:32.480 --> 39:34.360
He is certainly not going to help you.

39:36.280 --> 39:37.400
Confess now,

39:38.920 --> 39:40.119
and it will count as your merit.

39:42.360 --> 39:43.920
Perhaps you may keep your life.

39:51.599 --> 39:52.559
How about

39:54.159 --> 39:55.400
filling out this list

39:55.960 --> 39:57.039
of names?

40:12.599 --> 40:13.360
Miss Xie.

40:14.679 --> 40:15.719
Mr. Zhao

40:15.719 --> 40:16.960
hasn't returned yet.

40:17.280 --> 40:18.960
Could something have happened to him?

40:29.519 --> 40:32.000
Zhao Ling has been too arrogant lately.

40:32.159 --> 40:34.320
Get someone to take care of it.

40:35.159 --> 40:36.000
Yes, My Lord.

40:40.800 --> 40:41.599
(Rose Pastries.)

40:42.440 --> 40:43.800
(Tingyun used to long for this treat)

40:43.800 --> 40:45.039
(when she was in Ganlin Town.)

40:45.559 --> 40:46.719
(Today is her birthday.)

40:47.199 --> 40:48.320
(She'll probably like it.)

40:48.559 --> 40:49.039
Excuse me.

40:50.039 --> 40:51.519
I'll take two boxes of rose pastries.

40:51.519 --> 40:51.920
Sure thing.

40:51.920 --> 40:52.679
Make sure they're fresh.

40:53.239 --> 40:53.719
Got it.

40:54.039 --> 40:55.199
They're all freshly made.

41:07.559 --> 41:08.559
Murder!

41:30.119 --> 41:30.679
Mr. Zhao.

41:30.880 --> 41:31.639
Are you alright?

41:32.480 --> 41:33.239
I'm fine.

41:39.079 --> 41:39.800
As expected,

41:40.639 --> 41:42.400
it's still not time to go home.

41:47.920 --> 41:49.000
Keep your mouths shut.

41:49.840 --> 41:51.039
Don't let Miss Xie know.

42:04.960 --> 42:05.639
Miss Xie.

42:06.400 --> 42:07.440
Have some water.

42:30.400 --> 42:31.880
These fireworks are truly beautiful.

42:31.960 --> 42:33.719
Even more so than the ones
in Ganlin Town that year...

42:33.719 --> 42:34.280
No.

42:35.880 --> 42:36.599
I've said it before.

42:38.920 --> 42:40.440
No fireworks

42:42.320 --> 42:43.480
can compare to the display

42:43.480 --> 42:44.880
Mr. Zhao put on.

42:48.039 --> 42:48.760
None can compare.

42:53.608 --> 42:57.642
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

43:01.508 --> 43:05.800
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

43:07.588 --> 43:12.490
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

43:12.670 --> 43:15.120
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

43:16.236 --> 43:21.070
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

43:24.383 --> 43:31.276
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

43:32.390 --> 43:39.116
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

43:39.616 --> 43:43.400
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:43.577 --> 43:48.003
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:48.222 --> 43:53.915
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

43:57.679 --> 43:58.320
Mr. Zhao.

43:59.440 --> 44:00.840
Your wound hasn't been dressed yet.

44:05.400 --> 44:06.119
Mr. Zhao.

44:06.519 --> 44:07.679
Why not go up

44:07.920 --> 44:08.800
and take a look?

44:15.480 --> 44:16.639
My duty is unfinished.

44:17.559 --> 44:18.760
My fate is uncertain.

44:19.519 --> 44:21.159
If I die in this storm,

44:24.360 --> 44:25.280
what then?

44:28.360 --> 44:29.079
I won't see her.

44:32.320 --> 44:33.840
Better to spare us both the sorrow.

44:36.224 --> 44:41.480
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

44:44.352 --> 44:51.199
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

44:52.366 --> 44:58.800
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

44:59.474 --> 45:03.194
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:03.535 --> 45:07.828
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:08.174 --> 45:13.920
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

45:14.523 --> 45:16.890
(Yu Residence)

45:17.840 --> 45:20.079
I heard your husband
works in the Ministry of Justice

45:20.480 --> 45:21.559
and oversees the prison.

45:22.039 --> 45:23.480
He's about to earn some new merit.

45:24.599 --> 45:25.480
They say

45:26.199 --> 45:27.159
Li Mao

45:27.920 --> 45:28.840
is about to confess.

45:34.719 --> 45:36.239
This bird has fine plumage.

45:36.599 --> 45:37.559
Though beautiful,

45:38.239 --> 45:39.280
it is noisy.

45:39.280 --> 45:40.880
It just can't keep its beak shut.

45:41.519 --> 45:43.480
If a tongue is prone to cause trouble,

45:44.320 --> 45:45.599
it should have been cut out long ago.

45:47.719 --> 45:48.440
Madam.

45:49.400 --> 45:50.960
Do you understand what I mean?

45:54.063 --> 45:56.637
(Next Episode)

46:02.880 --> 46:03.840
(Miss, look.)

46:04.039 --> 46:05.719
(Commander Zhao)

46:05.719 --> 46:07.360
(is leading men to raid the house
next door.)

46:09.400 --> 46:10.519
Once Li Mao dies,

46:10.760 --> 46:12.400
Commander Zhao
will be in danger himself.

46:13.000 --> 46:14.000
In this picture,

46:14.800 --> 46:16.000
there is no place for you.

46:16.679 --> 46:17.159
However,

46:17.960 --> 46:19.079
the convicted official Li Mao

46:19.440 --> 46:20.519
repented on his deathbed

46:20.679 --> 46:21.840
and confessed to his crimes.

46:22.039 --> 46:24.559
(Memorial: Gandu Military Embezzlement)
He also wrote down his co-conspirators.

46:25.400 --> 46:26.880
I await Your Majesty's judgment.

46:40.280 --> 46:44.600
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

46:48.200 --> 46:52.560
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

46:54.680 --> 46:59.320
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

46:59.560 --> 47:02.360
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

47:03.520 --> 47:08.160
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

47:11.360 --> 47:18.200
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

47:19.080 --> 47:25.600
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

47:26.560 --> 47:30.000
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

47:30.520 --> 47:34.720
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

47:35.000 --> 47:40.680
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

47:52.800 --> 47:56.680
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

48:00.600 --> 48:04.600
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

48:06.320 --> 48:11.000
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

48:11.320 --> 48:14.000
♪Kept close within my heart♪

48:15.080 --> 48:19.920
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

48:23.440 --> 48:30.360
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

